## About the Business

Kasi-Tech Solutions was founded in **2023** as a small freelance IT collective offering hardware support and basic network setups. It has since grown into a full-service technology consulting firm specialising in:

- Custom web development
- Network infrastructure
- Database design & system analysis
- IT support for local businesses

**Tagline:** *In pursuit of digital excellence*

---

## Pages

| Page            | File                | Description                                              |
|-----------------|---------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|
| Home            | `index.html`        | Hero banner, service highlights, and call-to-action      |
| About Us        | `pages/about.html`  | Company history, mission, vision, and team members       |
| Services        | `pages/services.html` | Detailed overview of the three core service offerings  |
| Enquiry         | `pages/enquiry.html` | Full consultation / quotation request form             |
| Contact Us      | `pages/contactus.html` | Callback form, contact details, opening hours & map  |

---

## Features

- Fully responsive design (desktop, tablet, mobile)
- Consistent branding with primary navy blue and gold accent colours
- Accessible navigation with proper `aria` attributes
- Contact & enquiry forms (ready for backend integration)
- Embedded Google Map on the Contact page
- Social media links (Facebook, X, Instagram, YouTube, LinkedIn, WhatsApp)
- Clean multi-column footer with useful links and contact information

