## Project Structure

```
kasi-tech-solutions/
├── index.html                 # Home page
├── css/
│   └── style.css              # Main stylesheet
├── images/
│   ├── logo.png
│   ├── Tech Picture 1.jpg
│   ├── webdev.jpg
│   ├── network.webp
│   └── database.jpg
└── pages/
    ├── about.html
    ├── services.html
    ├── enquiry.html
    └── contactus.html
```

> **Note:** Some HTML files currently use slightly different path casing (e.g. `About.html` vs `about.html`). It is recommended to standardise all filenames to lowercase for consistency across operating systems.

---

## Technologies Used

- **HTML5** – Semantic structure
- **CSS3** – Custom properties (CSS variables), Flexbox, Grid, media queries
- **Font Awesome 6.5.1** – Icons (via CDN)
- **Google Maps Embed** – Location map on Contact page

No JavaScript frameworks or build tools are required. The site is pure static HTML/CSS.

---

## How to Run Locally

1. Download or clone the project folder.
2. Open `index.html` in any modern web browser  
   **or**  
   Use a local development server (recommended):

   ```bash
   # Using Python
   python -m http.server 8000

   # Using VS Code Live Server extension
   # Right-click index.html → "Open with Live Server"
   ```

3. Navigate to `http://localhost:8000` (or the address shown by your server).

