## Colour Palette

| Variable          | Value                  | Usage                    |
|-------------------|------------------------|--------------------------|
| `--primary`       | `hsl(226, 71%, 24%)`   | Header, buttons, links   |
| `--primary-dark`  | `#0b2942`              | Dark accents, headings   |
| `--accent`        | `#f4b41a`              | Highlights, hover states |
| `--background`    | `#c5cdd4`              | Page background          |
| `--surface`       | `#ffffff`              | Cards and forms          |
| `--text`          | `#263238`              | Body text                |
| `--border`        | `#d8e2ec`              | Borders and dividers     |

